    "detailed_description": "A small Real-Time Strategy game with a cute drawn style.<br><br>Your villages are under attack! Collect resources, build up towns, defences and prepare small armies to survive.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> A cute drawn art style<br></li><li> Base building<br></li><li> Resource management<br></li><li> Real-Time Combat</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Approachable</h2>FEYGHT is designed to be a more accessible and approachable take on the RTS genre. <br>If you're new to the genre, or just want a more chill RTS experience, this might be the game for you.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1659380/extras/12c0d618b21fbe728984608889a9a080.avif?t=1749056356\" /></div>",
